    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson BiopicMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black DressPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long HiatusBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nTV\n‘Splitsvilla’ 16 Ep 55 OTT Release Date And Time: Grand Finale Begins After Emotional Episode 54 Eliminations And Semi-Final Drama\n‘Splitsvilla’ 16 Ep 55 OTT Release Date And Time: Grand Finale Begins After Emotional Episode 54 Eliminations And Semi-Final Drama\n‘Splitsvilla 16’ grand finale week has officially begun after emotional eliminations and intense semi-final tasks in Episode 54. Here’s everything to know about Splitsvilla Episode 55 OTT release date.\nRishika SinghMay 15, 2026, 17:20 IST\n\nSeven couples walked into Episode 54. Not all of them walked out with their game intact. The penultimate episode of Splitsvilla 16 was the kind that reminded everyone why this show keeps people hooked, and now, with four couples confirmed for the finale, tonight's episode on MTV and JioHotstar is the one that actually matters. The road to the finale was never going to be clean. Someone had to go, someone had to fight for survival, and Episode 54 delivered all of that in one sitting.\n\n‘Splitsvilla 16’ Episode 55 Grand Finale: OTT Release Date, Time and What Is at Stake\n\nTonight, 15 May 2026, at 7 pm on MTV India and JioHotstar, the Splitsvilla 16 grand finale kicks off. It wraps up on Sunday, 16 May, at the same time on both platforms. The couple that wins takes home Rs 20 lakh.\n\nGoing into tonight, the four finalists are Gullu and Kaira, Tayne and Soundharya, Sorab and Niharika and Ruru and Yogesh. Gullu and Kaira hold the Ticket to Finale advantage. Sorab and Niharika head in with the highest Splitcoin count at over 1.98 lakh. Ruru and Yogesh are close behind.\n\n‘Splitsvilla 16’ Episode 54 Recap: The Night Himanshu and Diksha Lost Everything\n\nThe cruellest moment of the episode came before the semi-final even started. Himanshu Arora and Diksha Pawar fell short of the 50,000 Splitcoins needed to enter the Pyar Ka Splits-Qila challenge. They asked for help. Sorab considered it, then stepped back. Sadhaaf said no. Even Sunny and Karan pushed the other couples to step up, but nobody did. Himanshu and Diksha were out, just like that.\n\nThe semi-finals that followed saw Sorab and Niharika edge past Suzanne and Vishu, while Ruru and Yogesh dominated Sadhaaf and Deeptanshu by a 150-point margin. Tonight is the payoff for an entire season. Do not miss it.\n\nTRENDING\n\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\n\n‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson Biopic\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\n\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n\nRelated Articles\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete Relationship Timeline of TejRan’s Love Story From ‘Bigg Boss 15’ to Dream Proposal\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n‘India’s Best Dancer’ Season 5 Release Date Update: Here’s Everything To Know About Karisma Kapoor’s Dance Reality Show Return\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi’ Season 15 Shooting Update: Rohit Shetty And Contestants Reach Cape Town, Here’s Everything To Know About The New Season\nTerms of use Privacy Policy\nCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved."
